<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Order Confirmation - SkillBridge LMS</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #f3f4f6;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      .wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #14b8a6, #0d9488);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 30px;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .box {
        background: #f0fdfa;
        border-left: 5px solid #14b8a6;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .label {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #0f766e;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 15px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6b7280;
        background: #f9fafb;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        background: #14b8a6;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Order Confirmed 🎉</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi there 👋</p>
        <p>Your purchase was successful. Here are your order details:</p>

        <div class="box">
          <p><span class="label">Order ID:</span> <%= order._id %></p>
          <p><span class="label">Course:</span> <%= order.name %></p>
          <p><span class="label">Price:</span> $<%= order.price %></p>
          <p><span class="label">Date:</span> <%= order.date %></p>
        </div>

        <p>You can now access your course in your dashboard.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SkillBridge LMS
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
